<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 35px;
  }
  h1 {
    color: #0052cc;
    font-size: 22pt;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #0052cc;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #00875a;
    font-size: 15pt;
    margin-top: 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe1e6;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .workflow-card {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    border: 1px solid #dfe1e6;
    border-left: 5px solid #0052cc;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .student-box {
    background-color: #e6f7ff;
    border: 1px solid #91d5ff;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .admin-box {
    background-color: #f6ffed;
    border: 1px solid #b7eb8f;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .result-box {
    background-color: #fff7e6;
    border: 1px solid #ffd591;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #d46b08;
  }
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #dfe1e6;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #0052cc;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  tr:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: #f4f5f7;
  }
  .badge-student {
    background-color: #1890ff;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }
  .badge-admin {
    background-color: #52c41a;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="background-color: #f4f5f7; border-left: 6px solid #0052cc; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
  <h1 style="margin:0; color:#0052cc;">🤖 Robotics Wala Hub</h1>
  <p style="margin:6px 0 0 0; font-size:13pt; font-weight:bold; color:#42526e;">
    1-to-1 Complete Workflow Guide: Student Action ➔ Admin Action
  </p>
  <p style="margin:4px 0 0 0; color:#6b778c; font-size:10pt;">
    (Jab Student ye karega ➔ Tab Admin kya karega — Poora Step-by-Step तालमेल)
  </p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #e6fcff; border: 1px solid #b3f5ff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
  <b>📲 Quick Access Links:</b><br>
  • <b>Direct Android App Download (APK):</b> https://raj80965.github.io/RoboticsWalaHub/RoboticsWalaHub.apk<br>
  • <b>Live Web Simulator:</b> https://raj80965.github.io/RoboticsWalaHub/<br>
  • <b>GitHub Repository:</b> https://github.com/Raj80965/RoboticsWalaHub
</div>

<hr>

<h2>🔄 1-to-1 Direct Workflow Matrix (फीचर-दर-फीचर तालमेल)</h2>

<!-- Feature 1 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">1. Account Creation & Verification (खाता बनाना और अप्रूवल)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    App open karke <i>"Register as Student"</i> karega, apna Name, Email, College, Branch bharega aur apni Profile Photo lagayega. Register hote hi screen par <b>"Pending Approval"</b> dikhega.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin apne <b>"Directory / Students"</b> tab me jayega. Wahan naye student ka card unki Photo, Name aur Branch ke sath <b>"Pending"</b> me dikhega. Admin <b>"✅ Approve Lab Access"</b> ka green button dabayega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Student ka account turant Unlock ho jayega aur wo full Dashboard me login ho jayega!
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 2 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">2. Lab Entry & QR Attendance (डिजिटल अटेंडेंस)</h3>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Pehle Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin apne panel me <b>"Generate QR Code"</b> button dabakar lab ki monitor/projector screen par dynamic Attendance QR Code open karke rakhega.
  </div>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Lab me aate hi Student apne phone me <b>"📷 Scan Attendance QR"</b> button dabayega aur projector par chal rahe QR code ko scan karega (Clock-In). Lab se jaate waqt dobara scan karega (Clock-Out).
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Student ke lab hours calculate ho jayenge aur Admin ke Dashboard me student ki live attendance percentage aur In/Out time log ho jayega!
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 3 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">3. Workstation & Lab Slot Booking (लैब बेंच बुक करना)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Student <b>"🗓️ Book Lab Slot"</b> me jakar Date, Time Slot (e.g. 2 PM to 5 PM), aur Bench (e.g. <i>Robotics Bay 3</i> ya <i>3D Print Station</i>) select karke submit karega.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin ke <b>"Lab Bookings"</b> tab me request aayegi. Admin check karega ki us bench par bheed toh nahi hai, aur <b>"Approve Slot"</b> button dabakar bench confirm kar dega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Student ke phone par <i>"Booking Confirmed"</i> ka green card dikhai dene lagega!
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 4 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">4. Robotics Projects & Mentorship (प्रोजेक्ट ट्रैकिंग)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Student <b>"Projects"</b> tab me jakar apna naya robot banayega (e.g. <i>"Obstacle Avoidance Rover"</i>), Tech Stack (ROS2, Arduino, LiDAR) likhega, aur jaise-jaise kaam hoga progress bar ko <b>60% ➔ 80%</b> update karega.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin apne <b>"Projects Monitoring"</b> tab me jakar sabhi teams ki live progress dekhega, check karega ki kaunsi team kahan atki hai, aur mentor guidance dega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Lab ke sabhi hardware projects ka centralized record mentors ke paas live rehta hai.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 5 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">5. Hardware Components & Inventory (हार्डवेयर कंपोनेंट लेना)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Student <b>"📦 Hardware Catalog"</b> me check karega ki lab me kaun-kaun se Sensors (LiDAR, Ultrasonic), Motors, aur Jetson Nano kitni quantity me available hain.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin <b>"Admin Inventory"</b> me naye aaye huye stock ko add karega, aur jab student ko component issue kiya jaye toh stock quantity update karega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Kisi bhi component ke kho jaane ya stock khatam hone ka live hisaab rehta hai.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 6 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">6. Project Expenses & Bills (प्रोजेक्ट का खर्चा पास करवाना)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Agar student ne project ke liye bahar se koi motor ya sensor khareeda hai, toh wo <b>"💰 Project Budget"</b> me bill amount (e.g. ₹1,200) aur receipt details upload karega.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin <b>"Admin Budget"</b> tab me us bill ko audit karega, receipt check karega aur <b>"Approve Expense"</b> daba kar grant pass karega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Student ka bill pass ho jayega aur project budget chart me auto-update ho jayega.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 7 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">7. Certificates & Leaderboard (सर्टिफिकेट और रैंकिंग)</h3>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Student kisi Robotics Competition ya Hackathon me jeetne ke baad apna Certificate <b>"Achievements"</b> section me submit karega.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin certificate verify karke <b>"Verify & Award Points"</b> karega.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Student ke profile par <i>VERIFIED</i> badge lag jayega aur <b>Leaderboard</b> me uski rank #1 par chali jayegi!
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Feature 8 -->
<div class="workflow-card">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#0052cc;">8. Broadcast Notices & Workshops (नोटिस और इवेंट्स)</h3>
  <div class="admin-box">
    <b>🛡️ Admin Pehle Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Admin koi bhi emergency notice (e.g. <i>"Kal lab 2 baje band hogi"</i>) ya naya Event (e.g. <i>"Drone Making Workshop on Saturday"</i>) publish karega.
  </div>
  <div class="student-box">
    <b>🎓 Student Kya Karega:</b><br>
    Sabhi students ke app ke Home Screen Notice Board par turant alert aa jayega aur wo Event me register kar payenge.
  </div>
  <div class="result-box">
    🎯 Nateeja (Result): Bina WhatsApp group ke seedha lab ke sabhi students tak official update pahunch jata hai!
  </div>
</div>

<hr>

<h2>📊 1-to-1 Quick Summary Table</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Feature</th>
      <th>Student Kya Karega <span class="badge-student">STUDENT</span></th>
      <th>Admin Kya Karega <span class="badge-admin">ADMIN</span></th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><b>1. Registration</b></td>
      <td>Details + Photo daalkar register karega</td>
      <td>Photo dekhkar 1-Click Approve karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>2. Attendance</b></td>
      <td>Camera se QR Code Scan karega (In/Out)</td>
      <td>Dynamic Attendance QR screen par chalayega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>3. Lab Booking</b></td>
      <td>Date, Time aur Bench select karke request bhejega</td>
      <td>Request check karke Slot Confirm/Approve karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>4. Projects</b></td>
      <td>Project banayega aur Progress Bar update karega</td>
      <td>Student ka project progress monitor aur guide karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>5. Hardware</b></td>
      <td>Catalog me stock availability check karega</td>
      <td>Stock add karega aur inventory manage karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>6. Expenses</b></td>
      <td>Hardware bill amount aur receipt submit karega</td>
      <td>Bill verify karke reimbursement pass karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>7. Certificates</b></td>
      <td>Hackathon certificates submit karega</td>
      <td>Verify karke Leaderboard points award karega</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>8. Notices</b></td>
      <td>Home screen par notice padhega</td>
      <td>Sabhi students ko urgent notice broadcast karega</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr>

<p style="text-align: center; color: #6b778c; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 25px;">
  <b>Robotics Wala Hub © 2026</b> • Enterprise Cyber-Robotics Management Ecosystem
</p>

</body>
</html>
